"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For an Aeroplan award, the Hong Kong routing departing earlier is the strongest schedule fit among these shown choices: it has the shortest elapsed time and gets you to Bangkok the evening of January 16. The tradeoff is an earlier SFO departure. The cash search offers a useful baseline, but it is not a like-for-like price comparison.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J8@2027-01-15T11:45-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-16T22:25\",\"n\":\"Earlier-arriving Hong Kong award\",\"v\":\"This Aeroplan economy award routes through HKG and has 9 reported seats. Its elapsed time is 5 minutes shorter than the later-departing Hong Kong alternative, and it arrives 11 hours 25 minutes before that option. The downside is leaving SFO at 11:45 a.m. The returned award amount is 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 107.40 in fees; the price scope is unknown, and the fee is reported in minor currency units.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J14@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T09:50\",\"n\":\"Later Hong Kong award\",\"v\":\"Also an Aeroplan economy award via HKG, with 9 reported seats and the same returned points and fee amounts as the earlier option, but it leaves at 11:15 p.m. and arrives the next morning. Consider it if the later departure matters more than arriving earlier; it takes 5 minutes longer. Price scope is unknown, and the fee is in minor currency units.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J7@2027-01-15T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T01:25\",\"n\":\"Taipei award\",\"v\":\"This Aeroplan economy award via TPE has 1 reported seat and arrives 8 hours 25 minutes before the later Hong Kong award, but takes 2 hours 50 minutes longer. It is a useful alternative if its earlier arrival suits you; it leaves SFO at noon and has the same returned points amount, with a higher reported CAD fee (also in minor units). Its price scope is unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C3@2027-01-15T08:51-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash-search baseline\",\"v\":\"The returned cash quote is USD 456, with unknown price scope, for a two-stop itinerary via LAX and NRT arriving January 16. It is a benchmark, not an all-in award comparison; the award points and fees are not a like-for-like cash total.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"These are assembled search results, not confirmed or currently bookable itineraries. Award prices have unknown scope; reported seat counts are search evidence, not a guarantee. The cash quote’s scope is also unknown. Availability and current prices should be verified with the booking providers; search coverage was partial.\"}]}"
